Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Episode 3

Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Next,0000,0000,0000,,…When the Green Leaves Flourish


Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Kanji,0000,0000,0000,,Zero points.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.41,0:00:11.07,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s… raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.94,0:00:13.81,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.19,0:00:19.22,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It may be raining, but I’m going to try my best to increase the number of confetti in the bottle!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:28.70,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Whew! That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:34.40,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Do…ba…to!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:40.04,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I got all muddy because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.14,0:02:17.76,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-It doesn’t matter that you got dirty, Ioryogi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.76,0:02:19.82,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The rain will wash it all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.25,0:02:22.63,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It {\i1}does{\i0} matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.63,0:02:25.12,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll still get soaked. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:26.47,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.14,0:02:31.33,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.33,0:02:33.52,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.91,0:02:40.36,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um… Sayaka-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.69,0:02:42.08,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:44.04,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.90,0:02:46.60,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,To your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.10,0:02:47.89,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:55.66,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.98,0:03:02.31,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But is it really okay for me to live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.31,0:03:05.03,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.78,0:03:07.77,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Now, let’s go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.77,0:03:08.79,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.57,0:03:14.40,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Let me introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:19.03,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose is my friend and the landlady of these apartments.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.03,0:03:21.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, nice to meet you. I’m Hanato Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.61,0:03:26.89,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san, is it? Nice to meet you too. I’m Mihara Chitose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:31.62,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,If there’s anything you don’t understand or have questions about, just ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:32.77,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.77,0:03:35.17,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose, I’ll leave the rest to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.73,0:03:39.35,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,See you later, Kobato-chan. I have to go back to the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.35,0:03:42.75,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.75,0:03:44.94,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll come by later to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.35,0:03:49.39,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,That Sayaka… always worrying about other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.74,0:03:51.96,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.04,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.79,0:03:55.00,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I’m counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:58.38,KT,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,She seems so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:01.02,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Shouldn’t you say, “I’ll be in your care from now on?”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:05.51,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You’ll be in my care from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.51,0:04:08.06,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Not in {\i1}your{\i0} care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.46,0:04:11.13,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,When will your belongings arrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.13,0:04:12.64,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh! Umm…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.68,0:04:15.29,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This is all I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:17.26,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,What about your futon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:18.57,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:23.38,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I see… Then, I’ll show you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:25.30,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:28.95,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Such a wonderful building.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.95,0:04:30.43,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.49,0:04:37.33,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Isn’t this a wonderful room, Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.36,0:04:39.65,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:41.03,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:42.59,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.59,0:04:45.36,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder where he went?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.53,0:04:54.02,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:56.58,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like leaving me behind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:05:00.38,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve told you! I’m just a stuffed animal here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.52,0:05:02.61,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.61,0:05:04.43,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Geez…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:07.82,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.82,0:05:09.37,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:12.66,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Preschool is starting soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:16.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.62,0:05:21.55,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I have to hurry… I’ll be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.10,0:05:29.55,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:31.51,KM,Nadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,I’m fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.51,0:05:33.56,KM,Nadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,On the other hand, this guy…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:38.12,KM,Nadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry. It got all wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.15,0:05:41.76,KM,Nadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,It’s kinda cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:45.83,KM,Nadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,There. Now it’s all clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:47.06,KM,Nadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.06,0:05:47.86,KM,Nadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.79,0:05:52.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.23,0:05:54.91,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,She is a lot kinder than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.23,0:06:00.21,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.35,0:06:03.10,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Did you like the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:06.47,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! It has a roof and a well-made floor. It's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.47,0:06:09.51,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Really? That’s good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:13.38,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.38,0:06:14.35,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:16.36,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Play with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.36,0:06:18.69,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m cleaning right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:20.54,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Then, I’ll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:21.86,KM,Boys,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll help too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.86,0:06:23.81,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:25.93,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.93,0:06:26.82,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:28.59,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.39,0:06:32.32,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You didn’t have to provide her with an apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:36.73,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,But since she came here, everyone’s looked so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.73,0:06:38.46,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn’t be so cold to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:40.82,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You always do this…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:45.76,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,How many times do you have to get hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.39,0:06:51.82,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Good point…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.80,0:06:57.71,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,These days, you need to be careful when forming new relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:03.96,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness the rain stopped, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.22,0:07:10.05,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The preschool is closed tomorrow, so let’s work hard to collect more confetti, Ioryogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:26.15,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The weather was clear just a moment ago…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.15,0:07:28.52,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why I told you to bring an umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.52,0:07:30.33,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.93,0:07:36.97,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn’t look like it’s going to stop anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:39.51,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No choice but to go and get wet then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.51,0:07:42.44,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, that’s not fair! You get to stay dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.74,0:07:45.76,KM,Chef,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t have an umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.34,0:07:47.72,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:49.34,KM,Chef,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:53.22,KM,Chef,0000,0000,0000,,You can use this if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.48,0:07:56.70,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.70,0:07:58.51,KM,Chef,0000,0000,0000,,You can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.51,0:08:01.21,KM,Chef,0000,0000,0000,,It belonged to a customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.70,0:08:06.56,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um… I’ll bring it back once the rain stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:10.21,KM,Chef,0000,0000,0000,,All right, I’ll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:12.85,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.96,0:08:19.14,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you dealt with that as a normal person would.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.81,0:08:22.14,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,So, if you go on like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.14,0:08:23.31,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.91,0:08:27.06,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This is where I’ll find information on who needs to be healed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.93,0:08:32.25,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Somehow, that makes sense.\NPeople come and go here a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.80,0:08:37.10,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:48.99,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn’t able to find out anything…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.08,0:08:52.09,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.09,0:08:54.41,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The umbrella I borrowed is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.41,0:08:55.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.44,0:08:58.39,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Someone might have taken it by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:09:00.72,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,They took it for their own convenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:04.41,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Is it okay to take other people’s umbrellas?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.41,0:09:06.13,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Of course it isn’t!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:14.24,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no. The umbrella the cake shop owner lent to me…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.07,0:09:17.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.86,0:09:20.20,KM,Nadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,We meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:22.78,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! The one from yesterday…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.78,0:09:24.16,KM,Nadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.16,0:09:26.29,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I lost my umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.76,0:09:31.43,KM,Nadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.35,0:09:35.65,KM,Nadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll lend you mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.65,0:09:36.51,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.51,0:09:39.55,KM,Nadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay! My house is just around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:42.77,KM,Nadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,If you don’t have an umbrella, he’ll get wet too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:43.65,KM,Nadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.43,0:09:46.54,KM,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Tadokoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.09,0:09:54.44,KM,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,If you eat too many sweets, you’ll get fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.45,0:10:00.74,KM,Nadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Be quiet! Katsuragi, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.74,0:10:02.13,KM,Nadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.13,0:10:03.16,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.16,0:10:05.06,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.06,0:10:07.46,KM,Nadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll hit you if you don’t wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:09.53,KM,Katsuragi,0000,0000,0000,,Won‘t you hit me either way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.53,0:10:10.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.71,0:10:12.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Katsuragi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.02,0:10:18.98,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,She’ll get wet, but she still lent me her umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.51,0:10:37.24,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:39.99,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.08,0:10:41.90,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:45.91,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,You have a mark on your face from the tatami. {Tatami are the bamboo mats on the floors of many Japanese houses and apartments.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.91,0:10:46.90,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:52.25,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I’m off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:56.28,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Having this mark on my face is so embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:10:59.40,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,She must be thinking strange things about me now. {I know I am. -Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.08,0:11:03.03,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:05.05,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.05,0:11:06.04,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:09.56,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:12.11,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,You knew where my school is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.11,0:11:12.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.61,0:11:17.70,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,When I went to apologize at the cake shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:21.36,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,257)}I was told that the green uniforms belonged to this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:24.37,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san is thankful too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:26.12,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.12,0:11:27.34,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.34,0:11:29.66,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you mean this stuffed animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.66,0:11:31.99,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,What an interesting name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.79,0:11:35.36,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,My name is Hanato Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.66,0:11:37.83,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,I’m Tadokoro Mutsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.83,0:11:38.94,KM,Katsuragi,0000,0000,0000,,Tadokoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.76,0:11:43.80,KM,Katsuragi,0000,0000,0000,,Your hair is sticking up in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:46.81,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Be quiet! That’s none of your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.39,0:11:49.03,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.03,0:11:50.61,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.72,0:11:55.73,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I have a tatami mark on my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.27,0:11:59.94,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,That’s because you didn’t cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.94,0:12:02.36,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.30,0:12:04.74,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.74,0:12:07.04,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I have morning practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.65,0:12:14.37,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That boy seemed a little unkind, didn’t he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.37,0:12:17.36,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He’s just like Fujimoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:21.51,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no! If I'm late, he’ll get mad at me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.82,0:12:29.56,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You’re a minute and 23 seconds late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.05,0:12:32.26,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,O-One minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.26,0:12:34.89,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,One minute late is still late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.89,0:12:36.61,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I’m sorry…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.16,0:12:40.60,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Did you sleep too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.60,0:12:43.87,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The tatami mark is gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:45.93,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It’s because of the futon jutting out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:48.63,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t have a futon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:49.33,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.78,0:12:51.83,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.33,0:12:55.58,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,G-Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.37,0:12:58.76,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Did Fujimoto-kun say something mean to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.76,0:13:01.10,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um… I…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:05.28,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He’s a bit blunt, but he’s not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:08.10,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,But if he bullies to you, please tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.67,0:13:10.61,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll give him a beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.61,0:13:13.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,B-Beating?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.30,0:13:16.15,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. Just like old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.64,0:13:17.85,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Old times?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.31,0:13:23.74,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! It’s finally sunny outside, so let’s air the futons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.74,0:13:27.02,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yes! I’m coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:32.14,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:35.04,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.22,0:13:40.54,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like it’s going to rain again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:42.81,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, do you have an umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.81,0:13:44.64,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.07,0:13:48.52,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun does. You should leave together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.52,0:13:53.03,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I have plans after this. Take my umbrella and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.03,0:13:55.55,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t want to share it with you. {HARSH! -Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:13:59.60,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Share an umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:02.46,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’s when two people get under one umbrella…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:08.70,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s just as Sayaka-sensei said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.70,0:14:11.58,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It really did start to rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.39,0:14:27.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The umbrella that someone accidentally took is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.11,0:14:30.05,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Eh, Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.05,0:14:31.67,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,We meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.67,0:14:34.04,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Tadokoro Mutsumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.04,0:14:36.66,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi is fine. What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.97,0:14:39.06,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,My umbrella’s back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.76,0:14:43.27,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,I see! That’s good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.27,0:14:47.40,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Are you shopping again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:52.20,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Yup! My stomach always grumbles after a hard kendo practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.20,0:14:54.60,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You’re really trying hard, aren’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.07,0:14:56.57,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:15:00.78,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,I can’t eat too much or I’ll get fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.78,0:15:02.36,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.36,0:15:04.13,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.13,0:15:05.58,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.58,0:15:07.74,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Here! See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.21,0:15:34.78,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! So that’s “sharing an umbrella,” right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:43.32,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.31,0:15:58.01,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:16:00.63,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,…looked really sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.47,0:16:04.90,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What can I do to cheer her up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.90,0:16:08.73,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows. That looked rather complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:16.16,KM,Girls,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening! Please open the door…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:21.14,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.28,0:16:29.64,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A-Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:31.09,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.09,0:16:33.34,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to disturb you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:37.45,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you. I’m the landlady’s daughter, Chiho.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.45,0:16:38.62,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,And I’m Chise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.62,0:16:42.39,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you too. I’m Hanato Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.39,0:16:44.29,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t have a futon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.29,0:16:45.76,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.76,0:16:49.02,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Mama said you can use this if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.02,0:16:50.95,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.95,0:16:54.01,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,She also said that it’s been used before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.29,0:16:56.07,KM,Girls,0000,0000,0000,,Well, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.52,0:16:58.48,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:04.26,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They gave me a futon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.93,0:17:07.50,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You are supposed to heal, not be healed yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:10.30,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:14.17,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I will cheer up Mutsumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:15.72,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.20,0:17:18.85,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well, I’ll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.53,0:17:24.73,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.48,0:17:29.90,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I think it’s best to leave her alone for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.68,0:17:32.98,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.81,0:17:35.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.91,0:17:36.57,KM,Katsuragi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.07,0:17:40.94,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I have something to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.94,0:17:42.92,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s about Mutsumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.92,0:17:50.30,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:53.42,KM,Katsuragi,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.42,0:17:58.09,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please share an umbrella with Mutsumi-san too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.60,0:18:02.21,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.30,0:18:06.18,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, “with Mutsumi-san too?”
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.71,0:18:08.35,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I suppose it’s impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.14,0:18:15.61,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.99,0:18:18.63,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.81,0:18:25.56,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi-san looked so sad yesterday…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.07,0:18:32.63,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,…when you were sharing an umbrella with another girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.94,0:18:36.63,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn’t really…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.44,0:18:39.21,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.09,0:18:41.72,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,That’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:45.64,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,That’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.87,0:19:12.85,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If I did something I shouldn’t have, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:18.15,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s just that I wanted to cheer up Mutsumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.11,0:19:21.93,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.36,0:19:25.89,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here! Share an umbrella with Mutsumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.14,0:19:28.56,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.56,0:19:30.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.42,0:19:37.07,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,I’d feel bad for that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:46.45,KM,Katsuragi,0000,0000,0000,,Get under it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:49.62,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,W-What? It’s all right if you don’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.58,0:19:54.27,KM,Katsuragi,0000,0000,0000,,I’m not going out with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.66,0:20:01.88,KM,Katsuragi,0000,0000,0000,,She… just forgot her umbrella,\Nso we went home together. {you are one jealous ghurl…}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.74,0:20:09.60,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,See, Mutsumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.78,0:20:14.15,KM,Katsuragi,0000,0000,0000,,Just get under it already. I’m leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.44,0:20:25.39,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Katsuragi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.39,0:20:28.91,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Wait up! I’m getting wet! {LOL! -Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.65,0:20:38.17,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,Move over a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:40.40,KM,Katsuragi,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.40,0:20:41.88,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,There’s no room. {Just keeps getting better! -Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:43.47,KM,Katsuragi,0000,0000,0000,,Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.47,0:20:44.71,KM,Tadokoro,0000,0000,0000,,But it’s the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:47.25,KM,Katsuragi,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you tell me to move over, the umbrella is still small…{It’s because the umbrella is small.}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.25,0:20:50.86,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi-san still doesn’t look very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.29,0:20:53.79,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’s fine that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.52,0:20:56.48,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.68,0:21:21.50,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s strange, isn’t it, Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.50,0:21:23.05,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.77,0:21:26.30,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There’s one more confetti now…{The confetti is shaking.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.79,0:21:30.68,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But you healed her for that very purpose, didn’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.68,0:21:36.73,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to cheer Mutsumi-san up, so I helped her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.73,0:21:44.57,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you healed her broken heart even if you didn’t mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.57,0:21:46.42,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.42,0:21:49.62,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The extra confetti in there is the very proof of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:53.05,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then that’s good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.22,0:21:58.08,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I can see that this isn’t going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.02,0:22:07.43,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,The presence I just felt…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.04,0:22:09.94,KM,Shuichirou,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong, Kohaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.33,0:22:14.85,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,No, it’s nothing, Shuichiro-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.72,0:22:16.85,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:24.44,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You did good this time, so I think I’ll give you high points.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.44,0:22:26.73,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.47,0:22:33.58,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A-Are you all right, Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.23,0:22:39.17,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Do…ba…to!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.47,0:22:41.46,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Zero points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.13,0:22:48.11,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s mean, Ioryogi-san. You said you would give me high points just now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.11,0:22:51.54,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Because of you, I am always getting soiled with mud or ink or whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.54,0:22:55.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay. The rain will wash it all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.00,0:22:57.49,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It won’t wash away my anger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.49,0:22:59.86,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1200)}No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
